h a credential to an account, which is a thing worth not having. Kept"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"separate from ["},{"code":"CreateOpaqueCredential","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"] because the tenant, the user and the credential"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identifier are all decided by the server — a client that could name them could enrol a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"record against somebody else’s account."}],"title":"ManagementOpaqueEnrollment","kind":"symbol"}}}